OL,3,GNEWSAFormer Scots schoolboy killed in
OL,4,Abattle honoured at Ukrainian chapel
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former pupil at a south of Scotland
OL,7,Fsecondary school who was killed in
OL,8,Fbattle has been remembered by the local
OL,9,FUkrainian community.
OL,11,FThey gathered at their chapel near
OL,12,FLockerbie on Sunday to pay tribute to
OL,13,FArkadii Petrov who attended
OL,14,FKirkcudbright Academy.
OL,16,FHe was killed on a combat mission in
OL,17,FUkraine last month just two days before
OL,18,Fhis 21st birthday.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
