OL,5,
OL,6,FThe service at the Ukrainian Chapel
OL,7,Ftook place as part of a "day of
OL,8,Fgratitude" to everyone fighting in
OL,9,Ftheir homeland but also a "day to
OL,10,Fremember" those who had lost their
OL,11,Flives
